Install tmux, then resume. Ninja picks up exactly where it stopped:

bash
sudo apt install -y tmux
tmux new -s build
cd ~/work/ascend/AscendNPU-IR
bash build-tools/build.sh -o build-ubuntu -j 32

Detach with Ctrl+B then D once it's running. Reattach later with tmux attach -t build.

Before that, check whether it actually got anywhere or died early:

bash
ls ~/work/ascend/AscendNPU-IR/build-ubuntu/bin
du -sh ~/work/ascend/AscendNPU-IR/build-ubuntu
